\nAvailable: Mon–Fri, 8AM–5PM','2026-08-31 03:09:31','2026-08-31 03:09:31'),(141,34,'agent',2,'ano?','2026-08-31 03:25:36','2026-08-31 03:25:36'),(142,41,'system',NULL,'Conversation started. Waiting for the Barangay Secretary to join.','2026-08-31 03:25:58','2026-08-31 03:25:58'),(143,41,'visitor',NULL,'hi','2026-08-31 03:25:58','2026-08-31 03:25:58'),(144,34,'agent',2,'hello','2026-08-31 03:26:21','2026-08-31 03:26:21'),(148,34,'system',NULL,'The Barangay Secretary marked this conversation as resolved.','2026-08-31 03:26:33','2026-08-31 03:26:33'),(149,41,'agent',2,'hello','2026-08-31 03:26:42','2026-08-31 03:26:42'),(150,41,'agent',2,'Child Immunization — Health Station\n\nRoutine childhood vaccines per DOH schedule.\n\nWhat to bring:\n• Child\'s immunization card\n\nFee: Free\nAvailable: Wed, 8AM–12NN','2026-08-31 03:37:33','2026-08-31 03:37:33'),(160,50,'system',NULL,'Conversation started. Waiting for the Barangay Secretary to join.','2026-08-31 04:48:13','2026-08-31 04:48:13'),(161,50,'visitor',NULL,'Hi po, need ko po ng help niyo.','2026-08-31 04:48:13','2026-08-31 04:48:13'),(162,41,'system',NULL,'The Barangay Secretary marked this conversation as resolved.','2026-08-31 04:48:45','2026-08-31 04:48:45'),(163,50,'system',NULL,'Liezel A. Fernandez (Secretary) has joined the conversation.','2026-08-31 04:48:50','2026-08-31 04:48:50'),(164,50,'agent',2,'unsa mana?','2026-08-31 04:48:55','2026-08-31 04:48:55'),(165,50,'visitor',NULL,'unsaon pag panguyab?','2026-08-31 04:49:12','2026-08-31 04:49:12'),(166,50,'agent',2,'ambot nimu uy, wako kabalo ana pud','2026-08-31 04:49:25','2026-08-31 04:49:25'),(167,50,'visitor',NULL,'charoottt, about bitaw sa barangay certificate po','2026-08-31 04:49:40','2026-08-31 04:49:40'),(168,50,'visitor',NULL,'like unsay requirements niya po?','2026-08-31 04:49:49','2026-08-31 04:49:49'),(169,50,'agent',2,'For the barangay certificate kay Barangay Clearance — Main Office\n\nGeneral clearance certifying no derogatory record in the barang